// Managed as a raw Home Manager out-of-store symlink so niri can hot-reload it.
// This file is shared fleet-wide. Put machine-specific directives in the
// generated ~/.config/niri-local.kdl slot owned by home/home.nix.

// The coordinator's DP-4 monitor may be mounted inverted. Keep this candidate
// disabled until the output is confirmed on-device, then express it through the
// per-host generated configuration rather than this shared file.
// output "DP-4" {
//     scale 2.0
//     transform "180"
// }
